# pocket-agent-api

Hono Cloudflare Worker — Google OAuth ID token verification, proxy to Pocket Node.

- `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` matches `pocket-agent-web-app` and `pocket-agent/.env`
- Routes in `src/`
- Pairing: [pocket-agent-web](https://github.com/pocket-agent/pocket-agent-web)

